Subject: [PATCH v5 02/18] platform/x86/intel/pmt: refactor rmw with a return value
Date: Thu,  3 Sep 2026 13:10:04 -0700
Message-ID: <20260903201002.1064889-22-michael.j.ruhl@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.43.0
In-Reply-To: <20260903201002.1064889-20-michael.j.ruhl@intel.com>
